{
  "description": "The data grid's key table, language-neutral: gridKeyCommand(mode, active, key, shape, options), nextEditable and initialActive from core/src/grid/keyboard.ts. The shape below has three body rows and the totals row; its columns are the row header, three data columns and the row total, in logical order. kinds and details give each cell's kind and whether it offers details. Keys are KeyboardEvent.key names; a modifier left out is false. mode defaults to navigate, direction to ltr, pageRows to 2, locale to en, negative (the editor's minimum is below 0) to false, and shortcut to the file's detailsShortcut (null: none). The accepted characters come from acceptsCharacter with the locale's symbols in core/src/number-field/__vectors__/number-field.json. An arrow at an edge moves to the same cell, so the key is still consumed. The core tests and the Flutter tests read this file, so both implementations answer the same cases.",
